{"k":"mat","t":"Matrices","cls":"12","u":"Algebra","s":[["Algebra of matrices",[{"q":"Matrix multiplication","f":"(AB)_{ij}=\\sum_k a_{ik}b_{kj}","n":"Defined when columns of $A$ = rows of $B$. Generally $AB\\ne BA$; $AB=O$ does not imply $A=O$ or $B=O$."},{"q":"Transpose properties","f":"(A^T)^T=A,\\quad (A+B)^T=A^T+B^T,\\quad (AB)^T=B^TA^T,\\quad (kA)^T=kA^T"},{"q":"Symmetric and skew-symmetric","f":"A^T=A\\ (\\text{symmetric}),\\qquad A^T=-A\\ (\\text{skew})","n":"Diagonal of a skew-symmetric matrix is zero. Every square matrix: $A=\\frac{A+A^T}2+\\frac{A-A^T}2$."},{"q":"Number of symmetric / skew matrices","f":"n\\times n\\ \\text{entries from }k\\ \\text{values}:\\ \\text{symmetric}=k^{\\frac{n(n+1)}2}","n":"Independent entries: symmetric $\\frac{n(n+1)}2$, skew $\\frac{n(n-1)}2$."},{"q":"Trace properties","f":"\\operatorname{tr}(A+B)=\\operatorname{tr}A+\\operatorname{tr}B,\\quad\\operatorname{tr}(AB)=\\operatorname{tr}(BA)","n":"$\\operatorname{tr}(A)$ = sum of eigenvalues."}]],["Special matrices",[{"q":"Orthogonal matrix","f":"AA^T=A^TA=I\\ \\Rightarrow\\ A^{-1}=A^T,\\ |A|=\\pm1"},{"q":"Idempotent, involutory, nilpotent","f":"A^2=A\\ (\\text{idempotent}),\\quad A^2=I\\ (\\text{involutory}),\\quad A^k=O\\ (\\text{nilpotent, index }k)","n":"Idempotent: $(I-A)$ also idempotent; $(A+I)^n=I+(2^n-1)A$."},{"q":"Hermitian and skew-Hermitian","f":"A^\\theta=(\\bar A)^T=A\\ (\\text{Hermitian}),\\qquad A^\\theta=-A\\ (\\text{skew-Hermitian})","n":"Unitary: $AA^\\theta=I$."},{"q":"Powers of a rotation matrix","f":"\\begin{pmatrix}\\cos\\theta&-\\sin\\theta\\\\\\sin\\theta&\\cos\\theta\\end{pmatrix}^n=\\begin{pmatrix}\\cos n\\theta&-\\sin n\\theta\\\\\\sin n\\theta&\\cos n\\theta\\end{pmatrix}"}]],["Inverse",[{"q":"Inverse using adjoint","f":"A^{-1}=\\frac{\\operatorname{adj}A}{|A|},\\quad |A|\\ne0"},{"q":"Inverse of a 2×2 matrix","f":"\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}=\\frac1{ad-bc}\\begin{pmatrix}d&-b\\\\-c&a\\end{pmatrix}","h":"Swap the diagonal, negate the off-diagonal."},{"q":"Properties of inverse","f":"(AB)^{-1}=B^{-1}A^{-1},\\quad(A^T)^{-1}=(A^{-1})^T,\\quad(A^{-1})^{-1}=A,\\quad|A^{-1}|=\\frac1{|A|}"},{"q":"Properties of adjoint","f":"A\\,\\operatorname{adj}A=\\operatorname{adj}A\\,A=|A|I","n":"For $n\\times n$: $|\\operatorname{adj}A|=|A|^{n-1}$, $\\operatorname{adj}(\\operatorname{adj}A)=|A|^{n-2}A$, $|\\operatorname{adj}(\\operatorname{adj}A)|=|A|^{(n-1)^2}$, $\\operatorname{adj}(AB)=\\operatorname{adj}B\\,\\operatorname{adj}A$, $\\operatorname{adj}(kA)=k^{n-1}\\operatorname{adj}A$.","d":"From $A\\operatorname{adj}A=|A|I$: take determinants, $|A||\\operatorname{adj}A|=|A|^n$."}]],["Systems and eigenvalues",[{"q":"Matrix method for $AX=B$","f":"X=A^{-1}B\\quad(|A|\\ne0)","n":"$|A|=0$: if $(\\operatorname{adj}A)B\\ne O$ no solution; if $(\\operatorname{adj}A)B=O$ then infinitely many or none (check)."},{"q":"Homogeneous system $AX=O$","f":"|A|\\ne0:\\ \\text{only trivial};\\qquad|A|=0:\\ \\text{non-trivial solutions exist}"},{"q":"Characteristic equation and Cayley–Hamilton","f":"|A-\\lambda I|=0;\\qquad \\text{every matrix satisfies its own characteristic equation}","n":"For $2\\times2$: $A^2-(\\operatorname{tr}A)A+|A|I=O$."},{"q":"Eigenvalue facts","f":"\\sum\\lambda_i=\\operatorname{tr}A,\\qquad\\prod\\lambda_i=|A|","n":"Eigenvalues of $A^{-1}$: $\\frac1{\\lambda_i}$; of $A^k$: $\\lambda_i^k$; of a triangular matrix: its diagonal entries."}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Determinant of scalar multiple","f":"|kA|=k^n|A|\\quad(A\\ \\text{is } n\\times n)"},{"q":"Skew-symmetric of odd order","f":"|A|=0\\ \\text{if } A^T=-A,\\ n\\ \\text{odd}","d":"$|A|=|A^T|=|-A|=(-1)^n|A|=-|A|$."},{"q":"Determinant of product","f":"|AB|=|A||B|,\\qquad|A^n|=|A|^n"}]]]}